// meshview 的模型底色：固定方向光 + 半球环境光，只写深度供线框判断遮挡，不依赖场景灯光。
Shader "MeshView"
{
    Label "meshview / Surface"
    Preview 3D
    Output "color"
    Properties
    {
        _color ("Color", Color) = (0.42,0.47,0.55,1)
    }

    Pass "body"
    {
        Label "Body"
        Draw Model
        Cull Back
        Blend Opaque
        ZTest Less
        ZWrite On
        HLSLPROGRAM
        #include "olib/model.hlsli"
        struct Input {
            float3 Position : TEXCOORD0;
            float3 Normal : TEXCOORD1;
            float2 Uv : TEXCOORD2;
            float4 Tangent : TEXCOORD3;
        };
        struct Output {
            float4 Position : SV_Position;
            float3 Normal : TEXCOORD0;
        };
        Output vertex_main(Input v)
        {
            Output o;
            o.Position = mul(float4(v.Position, 1), Wvp);
            o.Normal = mul(v.Normal, (float3x3)World);
            return o;
        }
        float4 fragment_main(Output v) : SV_Target0
        {
            float3 n = normalize(v.Normal);
            float sun = saturate(dot(n, normalize(float3(-0.45, 0.8, 0.55))));
            float sky = 0.5 + 0.5 * n.y;
            float3 color = _color.rgb * (0.35 + 0.25 * sky + 0.6 * sun);
            return float4(color, 1);
        }
        ENDHLSL
    }
}
